      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ETHAN'S BROTHER (1) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 0.8 lengths (19.05) behind Man On Fire at Q Straight. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from five starts. Must come into calculations. BLUE MAGICIAN (6) was a most impressive winner last time scoring by 6 lengths at this track in a handy 29.97. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. BIONIC BELLA (2) pinged the lids and led throughout to score last start (25.58) at Q Lakeside in Grade 6 over 457m. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Sure to measure up. IDEA'S MAN (8) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 3/4 at Capalaba over 366m.",
